{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05677","headline":"送赵大夫护边 · 孙逖","name":"送赵大夫护边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"外域分都护，中台命职方。\n欲传清庙略，先取剧曹郎。\n已佩登坛印，犹怀伏奏香。\n百壶开祖饯，驷牡戒戎装。\n青海连西掖，黄河带北凉。\n关山瞻汉月，戈劒宿胡霜。\n体国才先着，论兵策复长。\n果持文武术，还继杜当阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05677.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05677","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}